Z||000003||Eric||04-10-2001||11:50 PM||||The cop shot the guy because he made a move to grab something out of his clothes.  This was after the guy ran from the cops for several blocks.  It turns out he had like 14 warrants for traffic violations and that's why the black community is in an uproar.  They say there's racial profiling going on.  They're probably right too.  If I was a cop on the street, I'd be more on edge around a 19 year old black man than I would be around a 59 year old white woman.  I mean it's silly to say to the very men and women who are putting their lives at risk to protect us, do not trust your gut in a life or death situation.  The black "leaders" in this country will keep preaching racism towards whites and further stifle the unity and blindness of color men like Martin Luther King promised us.  I can't believe we as Americans let people incourage riots over our radio airwaves. ||||reg||1
