Z||000051||ray b||04-15-2001||12:50 PM||||most cops are good hard working people but the blue wall that is their law about never report a bad cop is the problem. they need a honor code that will not allow a bad cop to be protected by his fellow cops.it a hard job to do and very dangerious but no one is drafted all chouse to be in that job.<BR>any cop who kills a unarmed person unjustly should be fired and never allow to work with a gun ever again at a minimum and other cops who cover his ass should be chared with full extent of laws broken.<BR>in a local case a man i know was shot by jump out squad for horseplay with his buddy while holding a radio that cops said was a gun so the cops call for the sock[a stolen gun they keep] to plant on him. but gun was traced back to cops that stoled it. and case is now in court with 5 cops chared in cover up.that what needs to be stoped not all cop just the bad ones.<BR>anarchy is when cops are out of control of rule of laws tooo.||||reg||1
Z||000052||bubbamcnasty||04-15-2001||11:48 PM||||First off, a word of wisdom to RayB:  With an attitude like that, Im surprised the cops didn't just shoot you in the 60's when they had that gun to your head.  You are the kind of ignorance that cause "racial profiling".  Every single one of your problems is caused by whites, and white cops...and on and on..  If you don't like N. America, move yo ass away.  Equal rights is just that.  White people are getting screwed out of jobs that they deserve, because companies have no balls to hire the deserving, just trying to fill their quotas sometimes.  Now Im not saying that all people of race are stupid,,,don't judge me like that.  If a company now has all white people, or all males working for it, and a woman or a person of race tries to get a job there, and don't,,,All you hear is discrimination.  Ray, you need to grow up, if you were a teen in your 60's that makes you an adult now.  I know that many terrible things were done to your ancestors, and maybe even you, but times have changed and its time to drop the b******t of the past.  Get over it.  People make mistakes, whites, blacks, browns, purples....whatever.<P><BR>Second thing... These states with laws that say you can shoot a would be robber.  Ha, try that in Canada.  Did you know that if someone breaks into your home and your dog attacks him, if you don't have one of those beware of dog signs, he can SUE YOU.  Don't even go into shooting someone.  You shoot someone, your up for manslaughter, assault whatever.  Ya Canada, Criminals rights first, Victims rights seconds.  Oh yeah, and some of our prisons up here for "minimal risk" offenders (you know molesters and violent rapists), have GOLF COURSES.   And we don't got no death penalty either.  Come to Canada and kill someone.  Free education (college level) and a golf course.  Go figure,,,,,what has the world come to.||||reg||1
